  "hints": [
    "Apply De Morgan's Law to rewrite F as (X + Y)' + (Z + W)' + V'.",
    "Use 3-input NOR gates from IC 7427 for terms like (X + Y + 0)' and (Z + W + 0)' by tying unused inputs to GND.",
    "Invert signal V using a 2-input NAND gate (IC 7400) configured as a NOT gate.",
    "Combine the outputs using the remaining NOR gate on IC 7427 and invert the result with IC 7400 to obtain F."
